188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We selected CSRNet for this project due to its use of dilated convolution layers, which effectively expand the receptive field. This enables the model to capture broader contextual information from the image without compromising spatial resolution. After feature extraction through these dilated convolutions, we integrated a decoder module to reconstruct the output dimensions to match the original input. This decoder combines upsampling and Conv2DTranspose layers, not only enlarging the feature maps but also allowing the model to relearn and refine the density map, resulting in more accurate and realistic crowd estimations.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
